  "description": "The meme is designed to target and provoke members of the general public who may be unaware of or insensitive to the deeply offensive racial stereotype it employs. The intended audience includes individuals who might find the juxtaposition of the text 'sea monkeys' with the image of Black children humorous or amusing without recognizing the hateful, dehumanizing nature of the stereotype. The meme functions as a tool to spread anti-Black racism by appealing to those who may not critically engage with the historical and cultural context of the term 'sea monkeys' as a racial slur. The target community is not a specific demographic group but rather any audience that could be exposed to the meme and potentially internalize or perpetuate the harmful stereotype, thereby reinforcing systemic racism.",
